      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-22-2025-june/q4",
      "question": "<p>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</p><p>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</p><p>A fixed point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> lies on a straight line.</p><p>A particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> moves along the straight line.</p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t \\geq 0\"></span>, the distance, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"s\"></span> metres, of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> from <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> is given by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"s = 2t^3 - 12t^2 + 18t\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is instantaneously at rest.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Find the total distance travelled by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> in the interval <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0 \\leq t \\leq 4\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(c) Find the maximum speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> in the interval <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1 \\leq t \\leq 3\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
